  "catalogId": "flange-dimensions-en",
  "catalogType": "FLANGE_DIMENSIONS",
  "standard": "EN 1092-1:2018 (Flanges and their joints — Circular flanges for pipes, valves, fittings and accessories, PN designated)",
  "version": "2024.2",
  "description": "European flange dimensions per EN 1092-1. Pressure classes PN10, PN16, PN25, PN40 for DN15–DN600. Type 11 (weld neck) dimensions.",
  "units": {
    "flangeOD": "mm",
    "boltCircle": "mm",
    "boltDiameter": "mm",
    "boltHoleDiameter": "mm",
    "flangeThickness": "mm",
    "raisedFace": "mm"
  },
  "fieldDefinitions": {
    "flangeOD_mm": "Flange outside diameter (D).",
    "boltCircle_mm": "Bolt circle diameter (K).",
    "boltHoles": "Number of bolt holes.",
    "boltDiameter_mm": "Nominal bolt diameter (M12 → 12).",
    "boltHoleDiameter_mm": "Bolt hole diameter (L).",
    "flangeThickness_mm": "Flange thickness of type 11 (C1).",
    "raisedFace_mm": "Raised face diameter (d1)."
  },
  "notes": [
    "Version 2024.2 aligns all entries with the EN 1092-1 type 11 tables: PN40 DN200–600 held PN25 values, raised face diameters were ASME values, thicknesses C1, boltDiameter_mm is the bolt size (M) and the new boltHoleDiameter_mm the hole. Checked with scripts/check-catalogs.py.",
    "Dimensions for Type 11 (weld neck) flanges with raised face (Form B).",
    "This catalog is not a substitute for the official EN 1092-1 standard."
  ],
